---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Whip - Untamed Weapons</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
					<a href="/gm-guide">GM Guide</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<div class="weapon-icon"><img src="/weapons/Whip.png" alt="Whip" /></div>
					<h1>Whip</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Control / Lockdown</p>
					<div class="stat-badges">
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 INS</span>
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 CHA</span>
					</div>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Overview</h2>
						<p>The Whip is a precision control weapon built around reading creature movement and punishing it. Whip hunters lock down monsters with Restraint — stripping speed and defensive options — then capitalize on a helpless target with brutal follow-up strikes. Every technique flows from or feeds back into Restraint, making control not just a tool but the weapon's entire identity.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Weapon Attributes</h2>
						<div class="attributes-grid">
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Tags</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Reach (15 ft)</li>
									<li>Two-Handed</li>
									<li>Light</li>
									<li>Parry</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Save DC</h3>
								<p class="formula">10 + INS mod + proficiency</p>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Special</h3>
								<p>Use INS for attack and damage rolls.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Core Mechanic — Restraint</h2>
						<p>The Whip's defining ability: crack the lash around a creature's limb or neck, and hold it still while the hunt closes in.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<h3>Restraint Rules</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Apply Restraint:</strong> Fast Action (1 Stamina), triggered immediately after you hit a creature with a Whip attack.</li>
								<li><strong>Save:</strong> Target makes a DEX save vs your Whip DC.</li>
								<li><strong>On fail:</strong> Target is Restrained — Speed becomes 0 and it cannot Dodge.</li>
								<li><strong>Upkeep:</strong> Pay 1 Stamina at the start of each of your turns to maintain Restraint.</li>
								<li><strong>If you don't pay upkeep:</strong> Restraint ends. The lash goes slack.</li>
								<li><strong>Backlash:</strong> If the target succeeds the initial save, the whip snaps back — you take 1d4 damage (no save).</li>
								<li><strong>One Restrained target at a time</strong> unless a technique says otherwise.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Damage Dice per Tier</h2>
						<table class="damage-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Tier</th>
									<th>Damage Dice</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1d6 + INS</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>1d8 + INS</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>2d6 + INS</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>2d8 + INS</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 5</td><td>3d6 + INS</td></tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Techniques by Tier</h2>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T1 — Whiplash</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>Only available while you have a creature Restrained. The target is held — now make them pay for it.</p>
							<p><strong>Requirement:</strong> You must be actively maintaining Restraint on a target.</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Make a Whip attack against your Restrained target with <strong>advantage</strong>. On hit, add <strong>+1 Power Die</strong> (one extra weapon damage die) to the damage roll.</p>
							<p><em>This technique cannot be used against a target that is not Restrained.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T2 — Trip Pull</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>Snap the whip low and yank — the target hits the ground and skids toward you.</p>
							<p><strong>Attack:</strong> Make a Whip attack vs AR. On hit:</p>
							<ul>
								<li>Deal base Whip damage + INS.</li>
								<li>Target makes a STR save vs your Whip DC or is knocked <strong>Prone</strong> and pulled <strong>10 ft</strong> toward you.</li>
								<li>If target is <strong>airborne</strong>, it is also <strong>Grounded</strong> (forced to land; loses flight for 1 round).</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Already Restrained?</strong> Skip the save entirely — the creature is pulled 10 ft, knocked Prone, and takes <strong>2d10 + INS</strong> bonus damage automatically.</p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T3 — Sentinel Lash</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">1 Stamina • Reaction</div>
							</div>
							<p>Nothing moves through your reach without answering to the lash.</p>
							<p><strong>Trigger:</strong> A hostile creature enters or leaves your reach (15 ft).</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Make a Whip attack against the triggering creature. On hit, deal normal Whip damage. You may immediately attempt to apply Restraint (Fast Action cost still applies, paid from this reaction).</p>
							<p><em>Fires on entry AND exit — not just one or the other.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T4 — Chokehold</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">3 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>You wind the whip tight around the creature's throat or limb and pull until something gives.</p>
							<p><strong>Attack:</strong> Make a Whip attack with <strong>+2 Power Dice</strong>. On hit:</p>
							<ul>
								<li>Deal base Whip damage + INS + 2 extra weapon dice.</li>
								<li>If target is <strong>already Restrained</strong>, it makes a CON save vs your Whip DC. On fail: <strong>Stunned</strong> until end of your next turn.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Forceful Restraint:</strong> You may apply Restraint as part of this attack even if it fails the DEX save — but the attempt is made at <strong>disadvantage</strong> (the creature wrenches back hard; you still pay 1 STA).</p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T5 — Serpent's Dance</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">4 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>The whip becomes a living thing, lashing out in three directions at once.</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Make <strong>three separate Whip attacks</strong> against up to three different targets within reach. Each attack is resolved independently (separate attack rolls, separate damage).</p>
							<p><strong>Coil Ward (passive while active):</strong> Until the start of your next turn, your reach becomes a zone of control. Any creature that enters or leaves your reach without your permission triggers a free Sentinel Lash (no Stamina cost, no reaction slot consumed) — once per creature per turn.</p>
							<p><strong>Chain Restraint:</strong> You may attempt to apply Restraint to each target you hit (paying 1 STA per attempt), up to your maximum Restrained targets.</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section playstyle">
						<h2>Weapon Playstyle</h2>
						<div class="playstyle-grid">
							<div class="playstyle-card strengths">
								<h3>Strengths</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Hard lockdown: Restrained targets lose Speed and Dodge entirely</li>
									<li>Damage scales sharply once Restraint is active (Whiplash, Chokehold)</li>
									<li>Sentinel Lash punishes repositioning on entry AND exit</li>
									<li>Parry tag gives rare defensive depth for a ranged-adjacent weapon</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="playstyle-card weaknesses">
								<h3>Weaknesses</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Stamina-intensive: Restraint upkeep competes with attack and technique costs</li>
									<li>Backlash punishes missed Restraint attempts</li>
									<li>Strongest techniques require Restraint already active — ramp-up dependent</li>
									<li>Limited against targets immune to grapple/movement conditions</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a; --forest-green: #2d5016; --moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a; --amber: #d4a257; --earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8; --text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}
			body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--forest-dark); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; min-height: 100vh; }
			.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
			.nav { background: var(--forest-green); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); padding: 1rem 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
			.nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; }
			.logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }
			.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
			.nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
			.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.breadcrumb { padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
			.breadcrumb a { color: var(--leaf-green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			.breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.page-header { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			.weapon-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-icon img { width: 540px; height: 540px; object-fit: contain; }
			.page-header h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--leaf-green); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.stat-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
			.stat-badge { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
			.weapon-section { background: var(--forest-green); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.weapon-section.highlight { border-color: var(--amber); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-green) 0%, var(--moss-green) 100%); }
			.weapon-section h2 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.weapon-section h3 { color: var(--leaf-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
			.weapon-section p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attributes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.attribute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.attribute-card h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.attribute-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.attribute-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			.formula { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); text-align: center; }
			.mechanic-details { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.damage-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--forest-dark); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
			.damage-table th, .damage-table td { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.damage-table th { background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
			.damage-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
			.technique-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.technique-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.technique-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0; }
			.technique-cost { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
			.playstyle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.playstyle-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.playstyle-card.strengths { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-card.weaknesses { border-color: #c74440; }
			.playstyle-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--amber); }
			.playstyle-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.playstyle-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.playstyle-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav .container { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
				.nav-links { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
				.page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
				.weapon-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
				.technique-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
			}
			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
